    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>Like <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Storage_Capacity\" title=\"Storage Capacity\">Storage Capacity</a>, this Upgrade allows gear to carry smaller gear within it. However, the gear carried in a Secret Compartment is concealed. It takes a DC 30 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check to notice the compartment when it is used, and a DC 25 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check to find it with a close, hands-on examination. <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> with a Secret Compartment can hold a single item one size smaller than the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> itself. (This is actual size, not weapon size; see <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment_Sizes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Equipment Sizes\">Equipment Sizes</a>.) Thus, a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster_Pistol\" title=\"Blaster Pistol\">Blaster Pistol</a> (Small Weapon, Diminutive object) with a Secret Compartment can hold a Fine-sized object (such as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Comlink\" title=\"Comlink\">Comlink</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Frag_Grenade\" title=\"Frag Grenade\">Frag Grenade</a>). </p>",
